  <h2>What a lab-grown diamond is</h2>
  <p>A lab-grown diamond is a diamond: a crystal of carbon, grown under carefully controlled conditions instead of deep in the earth. It is cut, polished and graded on the same 4Cs &ndash; cut, colour, clarity and carat.</p>

  <h2>What we make</h2>
  <p>Solitaire and cluster rings, earrings, pendants, bracelets, necklaces and bridal sets. Lab-grown diamonds make larger and bolder designs easier to plan, and every piece can be customised in gold karat, diamond quality and design.</p>

  <h2>Certified and hallmarked</h2>
  <p>Our lab-grown diamonds come with certificates from recognised laboratories such as IGI, TGL and EGL where applicable, clearly stating that the stone is laboratory-grown. Gold jewellery is BIS HUID hallmarked.</p>

  <h2>Buying from outside Surat</h2>
  <p>Video calls, NEFT or UPI payment and free insured delivery to major Indian cities. See <a href="/delivery-across-india">Delivery across India</a>.</p>
